  "description": "PubMed Database workflow skill. Use this skill when the user needs Direct REST API access to PubMed. Advanced Boolean/MeSH queries, E-utilities API, batch processing, citation management. For Python workflows, prefer biopython (Bio.Entrez). Use this for direct HTTP/REST work or custom API implementations and the operator should rely on the packaged workflow, support pack, troubleshooting notes, and provenance links before merging or handing off.",
